 ,t}(x)\\to B_\\lambda (x)$\">$B_{\\lambda ,t}(x)\\to B_\\lambda (x)$</span> as <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t\\to \\infty $\">$t\\to \\infty $</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch </p><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Abusemann-approx-antitone\">↗ lem:busemann-approx-antitone</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Abusemann-approx-lower-bound\">↗ lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound</a> A decreasing real function bounded below converges to its infimum. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-function","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-le-approx","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-function","title":"def:busemann-function","label":"def:busemann-function"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-antitone","title":"lem:busemann-approx-antitone","label":"lem:busemann-approx-antitone"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","title":"lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","label":"lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:asymptotic-ray","title":"lem:asymptotic-ray","label":"lem:asymptotic-ray"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node